Subject: [PATCH] realtek: verified ACPU startup and cached opaque DRM scanout

Final FC adaptations against the attributed imported ACPU driver: verify the
fresh secure handoff, defer boot display, prepare bounded IRQ/RPC rings, and
use the RTD1395 picture and TV-system layouts. Present cached GEM application
buffers through owned opaque scanout with bounded firmware-context reuse.
Original source copyright and license notices are retained.

